   limited by the same TRACEPROBE_MAX_NESTED_LEVEL.
 - Extend TRACEPROBE_MAX_NESTED_LEVEL to 8.
 - Fix testcase to check TOO_MANY_NESTED instead of TOO_MANY_OPS
   (that should not be hit anymore)
